Update lang/php85 to PHP 8.5.12, a security release.

The pinned pkgsrc-2026Q3 recipe is at 8.5.10. PHP 8.5.11 (2026-09-24) and
8.5.12 (2026-10-22) fix security issues, among them GHSA-w8hw-w9fx-j79w and
GHSA-6wmf-4rv5-p3rp (state corruption via bailout), CVE-2026-91765,
CVE-2026-91766, CVE-2026-91767, CVE-2026-91768, CVE-2026-91769,
CVE-2026-92842, CVE-2026-93682, CVE-2026-6103, CVE-2025-14181 and
CVE-2025-1218.
EmberBSD keeps one PHP, so 8.5.12 replaces 8.5.10. The bundled extension
packages (php85-*) take PHP_VERSION and this distinfo, so they follow.
The SHA256 of php-8.5.12.tar.xz matches php.net
(08bc2eba2a588654ade1357174aa646b761556c862dda0678345ee29ed481209);
the distinfo matches pkgsrc trunk (taca, 38031f5). All local patches apply.
Applies after pkgsrc-php-one-version.patch and php85-cross-build-cc.patch.
Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted), backport of pkgsrc 45fff24 and 38031f5.

--- a/lang/php/phpversion.mk
+++ b/lang/php/phpversion.mk
@@ -108,7 +108,7 @@
 PHPVERSION_MK=	defined
 
 # Define each PHP's version.
-PHP85_VERSION=	8.5.10
+PHP85_VERSION=	8.5.12
 
 _VARGROUPS+=	php
 _USER_VARS.php=	PHP_VERSION_DEFAULT
--- a/lang/php85/Makefile
+++ b/lang/php85/Makefile
@@ -4,7 +4,6 @@
 # We can't omit PKGNAME here to handle PKG_OPTIONS.
 #
 PKGNAME=		${PHP_PKG_PREFIX}-${PHP_VERSION}
-PKGREVISION=		1
 CATEGORIES=		lang
 
 COMMENT=		PHP Hypertext Preprocessor version 8.5
--- a/lang/php85/distinfo
